  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TERI Norway Inst Climate Energy (II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement seeks to examine India&#x2019;s economic growth and development objectives from the perspective of climate change and sustainable development with a focus on efficient resource utilization.</narrative>
  </description>
